{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、\n初めて読んでくださった方、\nコメントしてくださった方、\nありがとうございます‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベビたんです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/18/8160247/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はお疲れ様です‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チャリティーライブ\n「いま、私たちにできること」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あいにくの雨でしたが、\n沢山の方が参加してくださって\nとても嬉しかったです＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が出演したのは\n♪会いたかったかもしれない\n♪左胸の勇気\n♪乃木坂の詩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまい、らりん、せいら、ねね、私\nのトークが一番最初でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/18/8160247/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緊張した><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"元気の源はやっぱり乃木坂familyのみなさん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/18/8160247/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なのよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなみなさんの元気の源は⁇せいっ←←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よみうりランドの時に\n初披露だった左胸の勇気にも\n出演することができなかったのが\n悔しかったです;("},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、昨日のチャリティーライブで\nみなさんの前で披露できたことが\n本当に嬉しかった‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度はアンダー全員で披露したい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46、乃木坂family\n東北で被災された方々に思いを込めて\n全員が心を一つにした\n最高のステージになりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、メンバーが読んだ\nみなさんからのメッセージをきいて\n涙が出ました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山のメッセージを\nありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後にみなさんと一緒に踊った\n乃木坂の詩は光があまりにきれいで、\nみんなが一つになってて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感動しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっとみんなの元気、笑顔が\n東北の被災地に届いたと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にご協力ありがとうございました‼‼\nたくさんたくさんたくさん\nありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/18/8160247/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/18/8160247/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/18/8160247/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/18/8160247/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"LOVE ＆ PEACE"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"csフジで\nGIRLS FACTORY見てました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/18/8160247/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れなのアンダーで出演してました:)\n♪会いたかったかもしれない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はぁぁぁ\n家入レオさんかっこええー..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ももクロさんもかわゆいー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/18/8160247/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/18/8160247/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/18/8160247/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の乃木どこ\nようチェックです‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベビたん*****bA by marika"}],"source":"archive"}